2026-11-12 14:26:33,860 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **FTP Account "gnome" Uploading Files** - Confirmed usage of FTP account with username "gnome" uploading files to server 137.30.120.40 (port 21) from IP 137.30.122.253. Three files were transferred: rhino1.jpg, rhino3.jpg (twice), and contraband.zip.
