2026-11-12 14:26:33,863 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 3. **University of New Orleans Affiliation** - The user "gnome" has legitimate university access at UNO Computer Science department (www.cs.uno.edu/~gnome/), suggesting compromise of legitimate credentials.
